<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Colorado</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Colorado — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from Denver's design district to the Front Range and the mountain resort towns, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Colorado</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Colorado, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for builder work to handleless German luxury for Denver, Boulder, and the resort market. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships, whether you sell transitional kitchens in Cherry Creek, mountain-modern in Steamboat, or handleless European fronts in Boulder.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in Colorado</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — American-made face-frame, inset, and custom paint; the workhorse line for Colorado's mix of transitional and mountain-modern projects, with a deep wood-species and paint program that fits the widest range of dealer customers.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for the clean contemporary kitchens that maximize usable storage.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for builder projects and budget-conscious remodels, capturing volume without giving up quality construction.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered European fronts for the high-end Denver, Boulder, and resort market, with protected dealer territory and strong margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage by WW Wood Products to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="colorado-market-opportunity">The Colorado Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Colorado's kitchen market blends mountain-modern aesthetics with urban contemporary design. The Denver metro favors transitional kitchens with painted-and-stained combinations — white or greige uppers with walnut or natural-oak islands and lowers — while mountain communities like Aspen, Vail, and Steamboat Springs lean rustic-modern with knotty alder, reclaimed textures, and slatted wood elements. Shiloh's extensive wood-species program and custom paint options serve that range, the <a href="/playbook/modern-inset/">modern inset</a> look is especially strong along the Front Range, and contemporary builds increasingly spec <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse frameless</a> and <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm's handleless</a> systems — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Colorado dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, factory coordination with WW Wood Products and Pronorm, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

